sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Client
    participant Filter as Filter (JwtAuthFilter)
    participant Ctrl as Controller
    participant Svc as Service
    participant Repo as Repository
    participant DB as Database
    Note over Client, DB: Bước 1: Gọi API bằng Token hết hạn
    Client->>Filter: GET /api/v1/resource (Headers: Authorization: Bearer <AT_Expired>)
    Filter->>Svc: jwtGenerator.isValidToken(AT_Expired)
    Svc->>Svc: Kiểm tra signature & expiry
    Note over Svc: Phát hiện token đã hết hạn
    Svc-->>Filter: return false (Token expired)
    Filter-->>Client: 401 Unauthorized (Token Expired)
    Note over Client, DB: Bước 2: Refresh Token
    Client->>Ctrl: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh (Body: {"refreshTokenStr": "RT_1"})
    Ctrl->>Svc: refreshToken(RefreshTokenRequest)
    Svc->>Repo: tokenRepos.findWithUserByRefreshTokenStr(RT_1)
    Repo->>DB: SELECT * FROM tokens WHERE refresh_token_str = RT_1
    DB-->>Repo: Token record (used=false, revoked=false)
    Repo-->>Svc: Token entity (with User details)
    Svc->>Repo: Đánh dấu Token cũ đã dùng (used = true)
    Repo->>DB: UPDATE tokens SET used = true WHERE id = ...
    DB-->>Repo: Confirmation
    Svc->>Svc: Tạo AT_New (JWT) & RT_New (UUID)
    Svc->>Repo: tokenRepos.save(Token_New)
    Repo->>DB: INSERT INTO tokens (AT_New, RT_New, used=false, ...)
    DB-->>Repo: Confirmation
    Repo-->>Svc: Token_New entity
    Svc-->>Ctrl: LoginResponse (AT_New, RT_New)
    Ctrl-->>Client: 200 OK (JSON body)
    Client->>Client: Cập nhật localStorage với token mới